        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9006P, Modern Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern 17-5/16 Handles for Front Doors comes packaged with the mounting hardware. Choose from oil rubbed bronze, satin nickel, or polished chrome finishes. The Modern Door Handle is a rectangle pull that is part of Omnia's Modern Ultima I collection--known for style and quality. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima I 9006P/440 Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 17-5/16\"  (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 17-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia 9006P Pull is also available as a <a href=\"/products/modern-back-to-back-pull-set-omnia-btb-9006p-440\"><b>Back to Back Mounted Pair</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
